2025 ANNUAL REPORT SUMMARY

A Message from Our Executive Director

Dear Friends,

What a remarkable year 2025 has been for Green Future Foundation! Despite
the challenges facing environmental education nationwide, we achieved our
most impactful year yet—reaching over 10,000 students and restoring 120
acres of vital habitat.

None of this would be possible without your support. Thank you for believing
in our mission.

With gratitude,
Dr. Emily Carter
Executive Director

